SUMMARY:FreeOnFriday?   Schoeneck Schlepp (23R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRIDE LEADER: Jan Zerfoss\
 , average pace \\~13 mph.\nCue and Ride with GPS link: [Schoeneck Schlepp]
 (https://ridewithgps.com/routes/40963829)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride
  Together**\n\nThis is a casual ride and the ride leader will ride at the 
 advertised pace. Some riders may ride faster than the leader so we'll like
 ly break into one or more smaller groups with stops to regroup periodicall
 y. Please stay with other riders in your pace group so everyone has someon
 e to ride with and nobody is riding solo. Usually no designated sweep but 
 nobody will get dropped.\n\nThere are bathrooms at the start location that
  are usually open. There is also usually a portable toilet too.\n\nPost-ri
 de or near-to-end-of-ride coffee/refreshments - [Courtyard Cafe on Main](h
 ttps://www.courtyardcafeonmain.com/) There is indoor and outdoor seating.\
 n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repai
 r kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate pass
 ing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Mee
 tup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on\nMeetup does not mean you are a
  club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/
 content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to 
 abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancast
 erbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\
 nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikec
 lub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3158472
 16/
