 Complex
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Jon Hartung\
 nRide Sweep: Cathleen Anderson\n\nThis 11-13mph ride is for those riders i
 nterested in adding distance to your rides in preparation for perhaps a me
 tric century or century later in the season. All riders will stick togethe
 r with a planned stop at approximately mile 18 at the Rise Bake Shop and C
 offee Bar for a quick refuel.\n\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together*
 *\n\nGPX and Cue Sheet: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/hs-rise-
 bake-shop-31f/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/hs-rise-bake-shop
 -31f/)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a bas
 ic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo elimin
 ate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership
  and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean
  you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/cont
 ent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abi
 de by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the R
 oad](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=
 257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/docs.ashx?id=454318)\nIn case of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Gui
 de](https://s3.amazonaws.com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Le
 ader_Guide_2026_123357428.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=
 1778249903&response-content-disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader
 _Guide_2026.pdf&Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).[https://rou
